  "description": "Real-time chat UI component for Blazor applications. Drop-in embeddable chat widget with SignalR, emoji reactions, typing indicators, and message editing. GPLv3 open source with in-memory storage. For production persistence, add BlazorChat.Server.SqlServer.",
